ial Linear unit.   The throughput of the system is analysed by considering a variety of datasets and performance metrics into consideration. It has been inferred that all the three parallel architectures have higher performance when compared with the existing classification systems. Also, our IELU performs better than the widely used activation functions in text classification application.","topics":[],"score":2543,"global_rank":47275,"final_score":2543,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":8783},{"name":"NetAllyCode/Compose-S3-Backup","owner":"NetAllyCode","html_url":"https://github.com/NetAllyCode/Compose-S3-Backup","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":6,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Download Mongo backups from the Compose API (formerly MongoHQ) and upload to Amazon S3","topics":[],"score":2543,"global_rank":47284,"final_score":2543,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":8784},{"name":"Mark-Bowers/QuadrupedController.jl","owner":"Mark-Bowers","html_url":"https://github.com/Mark-Bowers/QuadrupedController.jl","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":3,"language":"Python","description":"Controller for quadruped models","topics":[],"score":2543,"global_rank":47287,"final_score":2543,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":8785},{"name":"jeffeverett/robinhood-git-hook","owner":"jeffeverett","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffeverett/robinhood-git-hook","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Incentivize frequent commits by displaying Robinhood positions and portfolio value after every commit.","topics":[],"score":2543,"global_rank":47294,"final_score":2543,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":8786},{"name":"Kieranflaherty/Image-Converter-Storage-Tool","owner":"Kieranflaherty","html_url":"https://github.com/Kieranflaherty/Image-Converter-Storage-Tool","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"This script will be used on a manufacturing line vision pc. The vision system is capturing images on the line and saves all th